@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] access-current-membership
VM permissions MUST derive from the immutable owner, current unarchived machine
and currently bound thread grants, and team membership through Cedar, subject to
immutable profile restrictions. These grant sources MUST remain additive and
thread grants MUST NOT be copied into machine grants. Customer grants MUST NOT
authorize access; only the owner may access its workspace. A cached browser role
or a historical grant MUST NOT authorize an
operation after membership changes.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:concurrency] access-change-terminal-atomicity
Sharing mutations MUST hold the VM row lock and commit grant replacement,
idempotency result and terminal revocation/fencing together. A failed transaction
MUST leave the prior membership and terminal authority intact.
